{"title":"Genius Blacksmith’s Game","synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\[Chronicles Of The Reincarnated Demon God]\nBlacksmith terakhir sekaligus pengrajin ulung yang tersisa di dunia.\n\nTangannya hancur karena kebakaran di bengkel, membuatnya tak bisa lagi menempa.\nNamun, sebuah game realitas virtual bernama Ares pun datang mengetuk pintu Hyun-soo.\n\n\\[Artefak Tak Dapat Diperbaiki.]\n\\[Tidak dapat ditempa karena batasan level.]\n\n“Eh? Tapi aku ini Blacksmith manual, loh.”\nBagi dirinya, batasan sistem sama sekali tak berlaku.\n\nBegitulah dimulainya permainan penuh gejolak sang Blacksmith jenius.","alternative_title":"천재 대장장이의 게임","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"fa5b6062-3cd9-4c40-97c8-dad2d2a4cb69","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"id":"62fd2c7f-49d7-4a53-8f85-3445b4da84ce","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"id":"4329efa5-a4b9-489f-baa8-64f93a36f25a","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"4f750f50-0d3b-46a3-b2af-31a264c92afe","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"9222bf10-15a2-48f0-9757-3ba61e1b1af4","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"id":"b4a90a42-e29d-4643-ace7-2b587224f516","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"id":"3fe61a0b-951c-4ba5-afe2-da870ada5fe6","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"26fc74fa-f143-4bf1-9050-102ba144a434","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"87a08631-2c58-4d05-942f-eed6cd599574","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"fea7f8cd-fe32-4634-bad1-6347fe0396ad","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"id":"07f7c464-4971-4abc-86cf-fe25d0639800","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"842c1b2e-5e8b-4d1e-a85d-c